# ── Mail (optional, via Resend HTTPS API) ─────────────────
# Render's free plan blocks SMTP, so transactional email uses Resend instead.
# Email is currently sent for waitlist promotion and organiser removal.
# Create an API key at https://resend.com/api-keys and verify the sender domain.
RESEND_API_KEY=
RESEND_FROM=N1 Badminton <notifications@your-verified-domain.example>

# ── Public URL (used when generating mobile check-in QR codes) ────
# Leave unset on localhost; set to your real domain in production so
# the QR code points at the correct URL.
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://n1badminton.org
